# Binaries
#
# `go build ./cmd/<name>` drops <name> in the repo root, so every cmd package is
# a stray binary waiting to happen. This list was maintained by hand and had
# fallen behind by sixteen names -- one of which (secrets-bootstrap) was
# committed, 3.5 MB of ELF carrying the operator's home path 337 times, and
# neither leak gate could see it. Keep this list generated from cmd/, not
# curated: `ls cmd/` is the source of truth.
/alert-notifier
/choose-llm
/cursor-tools
/eval-smoke
/fleet-agent
/github-sync
/helixon
/helixon-eval
/helixon-slo-ack
/notify
/onepassword-bootstrap
/registra
/secrets-bootstrap
/send-end-email
/session-audit
/svcregistry-bridge
/svcregistryd
/tools/email-vendor-rotation/email-vendor-rotation
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

